  f:'It isn&rsquo;t one day. It&rsquo;s my best week.',
  n:'Every hour of it happened. Just not on the same Tuesday.'},
 done:'A day still has twenty-four hours, however beautiful the video is.',
 teacher:{sec:'5 min',
  do:'Ask the question and WAIT. Take whatever comes, in his own language if it has to be, and only then let her answer. The waiting is the scene.',
  watch:'There is nothing cruel here and it is worth saying so. She did all of it &mdash; just not in one day. Every perfect day online is edited, and your student has probably posted one.',
  stuck:'Ask: can somebody do all of this in one day? Then ask: in one week?',
  strong:'Ask which hour of his own week he would cut out of the video.'}},

